## AI/DLC pipeline

The AI/DLC autonomous development pipeline is available via the
`/ai-dlc` skill. Pipeline operating rules (autonomy rules, session
model, recovery protocol, gate validation) live in the skill and
load into context ONLY when `/ai-dlc` is invoked. When the skill is
not invoked, this file and project code are the only project-specific
context Claude sees.

- Skill entry point: `.claude/skills/ai-dlc/SKILL.md`
- Step files: `.claude/skills/ai-dlc/steps/`
- Team role definitions: `.claude/team-roles/`
- Onboarding and phase reference: `QUICKSTART.md`

This file does NOT contain AI/DLC autonomy rules, session model
directives, or pipeline recovery protocols. If you are looking for
Rule 1 through Rule 26, the Post-Compact Recovery Protocol, or the
context threshold reminders, read SKILL.md instead.

