## Coding Conventions

Coding conventions for this project live in `docs/coding-conventions.md`.
Any agent writing or reviewing code in this project MUST read that file
before starting. This applies whether the work is inside the AI/DLC
pipeline or a one-off change. All work in this repository, pipeline or
not, follows the minimum-mechanism principle (KISS): the smallest
design that meets the requirement, no speculative machinery,
simplification valued equally with addition. Details:
`docs/coding-conventions.md`.

